-Source: [Autoresearch in Mixed-Integer Linear and Nonlinear Programming](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.39360), **“Metrics”** and ablation discussion accompanying **Table 3**, paragraph beginning **“The joint design also achieves earlier completion.”**
